@TaskFlow.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5171

### Register a new user — 201 Created
POST {{TaskFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "ExamplePassword123!"
}

### Duplicate email — 409 Conflict
POST {{TaskFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "ExamplePassword123!"
}

### Invalid input — 400 Bad Request
POST {{TaskFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "123"
}

### Log in — 200 OK, sets the taskflow.session cookie
POST {{TaskFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "ExamplePassword123!"
}

### Invalid credentials — 401 Unauthorized (same message for unknown email)
POST {{TaskFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

### Current user — 200 OK with a session cookie, 401 without
GET {{TaskFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me

### Log out — 204 No Content, clears the session cookie
POST {{TaskFlow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout

###
